{"v":4,"catch":"在廣闊的NOVA世界中消滅瘋狂的機器人！","desc":"“NOVA2001”是UPL在1983年發行的射擊遊戲。\n玩家控制一個可以向各個方向射擊的戰鬥機。 並且，其主要目的是繼續擊敗每個階段出現的各種敵人。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-07-29","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/656d253b0c41c7f3f1e7e122f1924c408798de95961b6727645c3828007be341.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/df2d1b88271b78405d0e28be354b1dd9a6b70a459ef7cc5912170afbc66a5fe2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d69e6d590d5e86fa1d4d944f7ac5635264f6d05b24a258ad0df6b1753afc3be6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d92ad341242cfc3fbdee3d9c228ef9129ec102c15ea1bb0aa70cb78a8d120f1e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fdf58481915d1582168ca3f006bb7f610b7673e563ff39bbd3be403ea6222deb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c7f4016382a698a370e19d823c84f7ed7a7561c5d8d84fddf11b9f5f5ad68559.jpg"],"titleId":"0100a5e009822000","dlc":[]}